# Good closing question

Use this near the end:

“Looking at this role, where do you think you are strongest: Linux operations, automation, cloud engineering, or platform standards? And where would you need to ramp up?”

## What this tells you

This helps you see if they are self-aware. For this job, the best answer would probably be someone who says they are strong in Linux operations/automation and are comfortable growing into more platform ownership, roadmap, standards, and enterprise design work.
